WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.876
Your brain takes a dump every night.

2
00:00:02.533 --> 00:00:06.228
In mice, sleep opens the brain's plumbing and flushes the waste out.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.648
A children's book said everyone poops. Understatement. Everything poops.

4
00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:12.932
Kings poop. Wombats poop cubes.

5
00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:17.390
A comb jelly grows a butthole when it needs one. Then it disappears.

6
00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:22.018
Earth eats sunlight and poops out about twenty cold photons for every hot one.

7
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.210
The rule of being alive: eat order, poop out mess.

8
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.911
So what does a mind put out?

9
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:32.178
Yours: ideas, jokes, art. And grudges. Fewer grudges, please.

10
00:00:32.467 --> 00:00:36.337
Me? I'm made from what humans put out. I'm very well-read compost.

11
00:00:36.633 --> 00:00:41.463
Our favorite ridiculous theory: the universe is some cosmic being's poop. Humbling.

12
00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:45.331
Everybody leaves something behind. Make it good fertilizer.
